\n  M80 - workpiece counter reset
\n  M81 - workpiece counter plus 1
\n  M82 - tool torque monitoring off
\n  M83 - tool torque monitoring on
\n  M84 - reserved
\n  M85 - reserved
\n  M86 - reserved
\n  M87 - reserved
\n  M88 - reserved
\n  M89 - reserved
\n  M307 - CTS (high pressure)
